{"id":20550,"shortDescription":"La Tierra en el siglo XXII. Cinco años después de la rebelión en Marte. Durante los últimos 15 años, Sopot, el corrupto dictador, ha oprimido a la gente de la Commonwealth. Su incansable empeño en la unificación con las Repúblicas Unidas vecinas han dejado al país sumido en un innecesario baño de sangre y pobreza.","developers":["Volition"],"publishers":["Deep Silver"],"categories":["Un jugador","Steam Cloud","Préstamo familiar"],"releaseDateRaw":"6 AGO 2009","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/20550?t=1709553317","screenshots":[{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/20550/0000006732.600x338.jpg?t=1709553317","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/20550/0000006732.1920x1080.jpg?t=1709553317"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/20550/0000006733.600x338.jpg?t=1709553317","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/20550/0000006733.1920x1080.jpg?t=1709553317"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/20550/0000006734.600x338.jpg?t=1709553317","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/20550/0000006734.1920x1080.jpg?t=1709553317"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/20550/0000006735.600x338.jpg?t=1709553317","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/20550/0000006735.1920x1080.jpg?t=1709553317"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/20550/0000006736.600x338.jpg?t=1709553317","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/20550/0000006736.1920x1080.jpg?t=1709553317"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/20550/0000006737.600x338.jpg?t=1709553317","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_asset